name: "viral-bench"
description:
    "A multi-agent simulation benchmark that predicts how viral an "
    "AI-generated app would be. A founder agent builds an app from a brief, a "
    "simulated crowd of agents then uses it and talks about it on a mock "
    "social platform, and the adoption and advocacy they produce become the "
    "score."

